cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model, please cite the frozen release you actually ran."
title: "Cardiovascular System Simulator: a 23-compartment lumped-parameter model of human cardiovascular physiology"
abstract: >-
  A 23-compartment lumped-parameter cardiovascular simulator covering posture
  change, vasopressor administration, mechanical ventilation, haemorrhage,
  neuraxial anaesthesia and altered gravity, with minutes-to-hours dynamics on a
  separate coarse clock. Built under a stated validation discipline: every
  physiological parameter is traced to a human measurement, every comparison
  states its cohort, and known gaps are carried as strict xfail tests so none can
  close silently. The model contains no random number generation, so the same
  inputs reproduce bit-identical outputs.
type: software
